sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser app
  participant W as Broker on Cloudflare
  participant G as Google OAuth
  participant D as Google Drive

  B->>W: GET /oauth/start
  W->>W: make PKCE verifier and state, seal both in an HttpOnly cookie
  W-->>B: redirect to Google consent, scope drive.file
  B->>G: user signs in and approves
  G-->>W: redirect back with a one-time code
  W->>G: code, client secret, PKCE verifier
  G-->>W: refresh token and access token
  W-->>B: sealed refresh-token cookie, back to the app
  B->>W: POST /token
  W->>G: refresh token
  G-->>W: short-lived access token
  W-->>B: access token as JSON
  B->>D: create folder, list files, upload ciphertext
  D-->>B: file ids and metadata
  Note over B,D: The broker never sees ledger bytes.<br/>Google never sees plaintext.
